[["cases",2],{"page":{"pageNumber":1,"width":595.276,"height":793.701,"lines":[{"text":"the present study) is more severe as compared to a monotherapy","fontSize":10,"x":56.6929,"y":454.40970000000004,"width":226.79000000000002,"height":10},{"text":"and the hematological toxicity (neutropenia and leukopenia) is","fontSize":10,"x":56.6929,"y":466.40970000000004,"width":226.92000000000013,"height":10},{"text":"substantially higher in treatments with polychemotherapy (6). The","fontSize":10,"x":56.6929,"y":478.40970000000004,"width":226.82900000000035,"height":10},{"text":"results of the present study show no positive effect with PUFA","fontSize":10,"x":56.6929,"y":490.40970000000004,"width":226.92700000000053,"height":10},{"text":"Ω-3 supplementation, and this may be due to the therapy that","fontSize":10,"x":56.6929,"y":502.40970000000004,"width":226.55399999999986,"height":10},{"text":"also had a greater reduction of mass body fat, while the placebo","fontSize":10,"x":311.8129,"y":454.40970000000004,"width":226.7900000000002,"height":10},{"text":"group showed a slight increase. There were no new cases of","fontSize":10,"x":311.8129,"y":466.40970000000004,"width":226.9260000000006,"height":10},{"text":"sarcopenic obesity during the whole treatment with chemotherapy.","fontSize":10,"x":311.8129,"y":478.40970000000004,"width":227.28800000000035,"height":10},{"text":"The results observed differ from those reported by other authors","fontSize":10,"x":311.8129,"y":490.40970000000004,"width":226.7489999999999,"height":10},{"text":"in different studies of breast cancer in advanced stages, as they","fontSize":10,"x":311.8129,"y":502.40970000000004,"width":226.77899999999988,"height":10},{"text":"Body","fontSize":9,"x":86.2646,"y":107.60440000000006,"width":22.004999999999995,"height":9},{"text":"parameters","fontSize":9,"x":72.61160000000001,"y":119.60140000000001,"width":49.32000000000001,"height":9},{"text":"Treatment group","fontSize":9,"x":61.76660000000001,"y":131.59839